    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Glazed stoneware with a distinct crazed lid glaze; the top view shows the lid knob and rim concentric, and the bottom view shows a correctly darkened unglazed foot. Both lug handles are modelled through-holes, not decals. Wireframe is clean and evenly distributed.",
